  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8104.01 Required Inspections",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8104.01 Required Inspections. Required inspections for work performed under the scope of the issued building permits shall be requested by the permit holder and performed by the fire marshal or designee at the appropriate times during the course of construction and prior to concealing any of the work.\n\nSource. #12022, eff 10-26-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c8100.html"
